#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:3
msgid "PuckManager"
msgstr "PuckManager"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:9
msgid "The ``PuckManager`` class manages the pucks present in the Webots scene."
msgstr "La classe ``PuckManager`` gère les palets présents dans la scène Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:11
msgid ""
"It centralizes all actions related to pucks: searching, distance "
"calculation, attachment to the robot, dropping, and tracking of delivered"
" pucks."
msgstr ""
"Elle centralise toutes les actions liées aux palets : recherche, calcul "
"de distance, attachement au robot, dépôt et suivi des palets livrés."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:17
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:19
msgid "Retrieve pucks from their DEF names."
msgstr "Récupérer les palets à partir de leurs noms DEF."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:20
msgid "Store the ``Node`` objects of the pucks."
msgstr "Stocker les objets ``Node`` des palets."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:21
msgid "Store the ``translation`` fields of the pucks."
msgstr "Stocker les champs ``translation`` des palets."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:22
msgid "Determine whether a puck has already been delivered."
msgstr "Savoir si un palet a déjà été livré."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:23
msgid "Find the nearest available puck to the robot."
msgstr "Trouver le palet disponible le plus proche du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:24
msgid "Compute the distance between the robot and a puck."
msgstr "Calculer la distance entre le robot et un palet."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:25
msgid "Make a puck follow the robot while it is being transported."
msgstr "Faire suivre un palet par le robot lorsqu'il est transporté."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:26
msgid "Drop a puck at a given position."
msgstr "Déposer un palet à une position donnée."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:30
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:32
msgid ""
"Information about the pucks is stored in private attributes: "
"``puckNames``, ``puckNodes``, ``puckTranslationFields`` and "
"``puckDelivered``."
msgstr ""
"Les informations sur les palets sont stockées dans des attributs privés : "
"``puckNames``, ``puckNodes``, ``puckTranslationFields`` et "
"``puckDelivered``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:36
msgid "``TERBot`` does not directly manipulate these arrays."
msgstr "``TERBot`` ne manipule pas directement ces tableaux."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:40
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:42
msgid "``PuckManager`` is owned by ``TERBot``."
msgstr "``PuckManager`` est possédée par ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:44
msgid "It uses ``Supervisor``, ``Node``, ``Field`` and ``MathUtils``."
msgstr "Elle utilise ``Supervisor``, ``Node``, ``Field`` et ``MathUtils``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:48
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:51
msgid "``PuckManager(Supervisor robot, String[] puckNames)``"
msgstr "``PuckManager(Supervisor robot, String[] puckNames)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:53
msgid "Constructor."
msgstr "Constructeur."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:55
msgid "It receives the Webots ``Supervisor`` and the list of puck names."
msgstr ""
"Il reçoit le ``Supervisor`` Webots et la liste des noms des palets."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:57
msgid ""
"For each puck, it searches for the corresponding node using "
"``getFromDef``. If the puck is found, it retrieves its ``translation`` "
"field and initializes it as not delivered."
msgstr ""
"Pour chaque palet, il cherche le nœud correspondant avec ``getFromDef``. "
"Si le palet est trouvé, il récupère son champ ``translation`` et "
"l'initialise comme non livré."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:62
msgid "``findNearestAvailablePuck()``"
msgstr "``findNearestAvailablePuck()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:64
msgid "Searches for the nearest available puck to the robot."
msgstr "Recherche le palet disponible le plus proche du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:66
msgid ""
"The method ignores non-existing pucks and pucks that have already been "
"delivered."
msgstr ""
"La méthode ignore les palets inexistants et les palets déjà livrés."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:69
msgid ""
"It returns the index of the found puck, or ``-1`` if no available puck is"
" found."
msgstr ""
"Elle retourne l'indice du palet trouvé, ou ``-1`` si aucun palet "
"disponible n'est trouvé."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:73
msgid "``getPuckNode(int index)``"
msgstr "``getPuckNode(int index)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:75
msgid "Returns the Webots ``Node`` of a puck from its index."
msgstr "Retourne le ``Node`` Webots d'un palet à partir de son indice."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:77
msgid "If the index is invalid, it returns ``null``."
msgstr "Si l'indice est invalide, retourne ``null``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:80
msgid "``getDistanceToPuck(int index)``"
msgstr "``getDistanceToPuck(int index)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:82
msgid "Computes the distance between the robot and a puck."
msgstr "Calcule la distance entre le robot et un palet."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:84
msgid "If the puck does not exist, it returns ``Double.MAX_VALUE``."
msgstr "Si le palet n'existe pas, retourne ``Double.MAX_VALUE``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:87
msgid "``isDelivered(int index)``"
msgstr "``isDelivered(int index)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:89
msgid "Indicates whether a puck has already been delivered."
msgstr "Indique si un palet a déjà été livré."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:91
msgid ""
"If the index is invalid, it returns ``true`` in order to consider the "
"puck unusable."
msgstr ""
"Si l'indice est invalide, retourne ``true`` afin de considérer le palet "
"comme non utilisable."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:95
msgid "``getPuckName(int index)``"
msgstr "``getPuckName(int index)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:97
msgid "Returns the name of a puck from its index."
msgstr "Retourne le nom d'un palet à partir de son indice."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:99
msgid "If the index is invalid, it returns ``unknown``."
msgstr "Si l'indice est invalide, retourne ``unknown``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:102
msgid "``attachPuckToRobot(int index)``"
msgstr "``attachPuckToRobot(int index)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:104
msgid "Places the puck in front of the robot to simulate transportation."
msgstr ""
"Place le palet devant le robot pour simuler son transport."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:106
msgid ""
"The method computes a local position in front of the robot, converts it "
"to a world position, modifies the puck ``translation`` field, then calls "
"``resetPhysics``."
msgstr ""
"La méthode calcule une position locale devant le robot, la convertit en "
"position dans le monde, modifie le champ ``translation`` du palet puis "
"appelle ``resetPhysics``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:111
msgid "``dropPuck(int index, double dropX, double dropY, double dropZ)``"
msgstr "``dropPuck(int index, double dropX, double dropY, double dropZ)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:113
msgid "Drops a puck at a given position."
msgstr "Dépose un palet à une position donnée."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/puck_manager.rst:115
msgid ""
"The method marks the puck as delivered, updates its position, resets its "
"physics and displays a debug message."
msgstr ""
"La méthode marque le palet comme livré, modifie sa position, "
"réinitialise sa physique et affiche un message de débogage."